{
  "name": "05 Záloha ve Stripe -> najít lead v Kommo -> úkol + tabulka Zálohy",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "stripe:watchEvents",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": {},
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTHOOK__": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "module": "google-email:sendAnEmail",
      "version": 4,
      "mapper": {
        "to": [
          "tym@example.com"
        ],
        "content": "<p>Záloha byla zaplacena.</p><p>Jméno: {{1.object.customer_details.name}}<br>E-mail: {{1.object.customer_details.email}}<br>Částka: {{1.object.amount_total / 100}} Kč</p><p>Lead v Kommo se hledá automaticky. Pokud se najde právě jeden, přesune se do etapy Záloha zaplacena a vznikne úkol Připravit smlouvu. Pokud je shoda nejistá, úkol začíná slovem OVĚŘIT.</p>",
        "subject": "Záloha zaplacena: {{1.object.customer_details.name}}",
        "bodyType": "rawHtml"
      },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      },
      "filter": {
        "name": "jen platební odkaz na zálohu",
        "conditions": [
          [
            {
              "a": "{{1.object.payment_link}}",
              "b": "YOUR_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK_ID",
              "o": "text:equal"
            },
            {
              "a": "{{1.object.payment_status}}",
              "b": "paid",
              "o": "text:equal"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "module": "amo-crm:MakeAPICall",
      "version": 2,
      "mapper": {
        "url": "/v4/contacts?query={{lower(1.object.customer_details.email)}}&with=leads",
        "method": "GET",
        "qs": [],
        "headers": []
      },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "module": "util:SetVariables",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": {
        "scope": "roundtrip",
        "variables": [
          {
            "name": "ids",
            "value": "{{ifempty(join(map(flatten(map(map(ifempty(10.body._embedded.contacts; emptyarray); \"_embedded\"); \"leads\")); \"id\"); \"&filter[id][]=\"); \"0\")}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "module": "amo-crm:MakeAPICall",
      "version": 2,
      "mapper": {
        "url": "/v4/leads?filter[id][]={{12.ids}}&order[updated_at]=desc&filter[statuses][0][pipeline_id]=YOUR_PIPELINE_ID&filter[statuses][0][status_id]=YOUR_ACTIVE_STAGE_IDS",
        "method": "GET",
        "qs": [],
        "headers": []
      },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "module": "amo-crm:MakeAPICall",
      "version": 2,
      "mapper": {
        "url": "/v4/contacts?query={{if(length(1.object.customer_details.name) > 4; 1.object.customer_details.name; \"zzz-nomatch\")}}&with=leads",
        "method": "GET",
        "qs": [],
        "headers": []
      },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "module": "util:SetVariables",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": {
        "scope": "roundtrip",
        "variables": [
          {
            "name": "ids",
            "value": "{{ifempty(join(map(flatten(map(map(ifempty(20.body._embedded.contacts; emptyarray); \"_embedded\"); \"leads\")); \"id\"); \"&filter[id][]=\"); \"0\")}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "module": "amo-crm:MakeAPICall",
      "version": 2,
      "mapper": {
        "url": "/v4/leads?filter[id][]={{21.ids}}&order[updated_at]=desc&filter[statuses][0][pipeline_id]=YOUR_PIPELINE_ID&filter[statuses][0][status_id]=YOUR_ACTIVE_STAGE_IDS",
        "method": "GET",
        "qs": [],
        "headers": []
      },
      "parameters": {
        "__IMTCONN__": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": null,
      "parameters": {},
      "routes": [
